18
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:51,040
Could you point to any conservatives who are not fascist?

19
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:53,000
Or is that a label that you apply to all of them?

20
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:54,480
And the answer is yes.

21
00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:58,280
Throughout history, there have been thousands of conservatives who are not fascists.

22
