There are many notable conservatives who stood up against fascism vocally and strongly.

23
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:07,680
Figures like Dietrich Bonhoeffer in Germany or Winston Churchill in the UK.

24
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:10,140
The problem is that conservatives have a weakness.

25
00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:15,900
