26
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:25,220
Fascists exploit this weakness in order to form an alliance with traditional conservatives, which they then hollow out from the inside.

27
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:31,640
Afraid of the left, conservatives form an uneasy partnership with fascists, thinking that they can control them.

28
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:40,400
The result is always the opposite, which means that most conservatives only end up becoming anti-fascists once they realize that it's already too late.

29
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:49,100
I think that if ICE started rounding up queer people into concentration camps, you would see a lot of conservatives in the United States hiding queer people beneath their floorboards.

30
00:02:49,100 --> 00:03:06,000
But what those conservatives probably would not like to admit is that they were so afraid of phantom threats like wokeness or leftist radicalism or cultural Marxism, which, by the way, is literally a Nazi dog whistle invented by Joseph Goebbels, than they are of rising radicalism and violence on the right.

31
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:16,580
Conservatives have a tendency to support and even vote for fascists out of fear from the left and then turn around and claim that they had nothing to do with the rise of fascism in their countries.

32
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:22,620
And this is because they don't realize that fascism is a process of radicalization rather than an end state.

33
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:32,060
It is about the consolidation of a cult of unity and national purity through coercion, mass mobilization and militarism.

34
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:43,040
This is why when conservatives echo the great replacement theory, talk about immigrants as invaders and obsess over internal enemies who are corrupting the purity of the nation,

35
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:48,420
and they don't often realize that they don't often realize that they are explicitly echoing fascist talking points.

36
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:52,720
And when they are, it's your responsibility to call them a fascist.

37
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,620
